.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-PATH-CONE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-path\-cone \- Compute the provenance cone of a trajectory
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu path cone\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-via\fR] [\fB\-\-hops\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fItrajectory\-IRI\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compute the provenance cone of a trajectory
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-via\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Predicate or path used for traversal
.TP
\fB\-\-hops\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Maximum traversal hops
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fItrajectory\-IRI\fR>

